r its when threats spawn, or the chamber you must complete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter-Based Story</strong>: The story is separated between <u><i><strong>3 Chapters</strong></i></u>. The first chapter is free and the rest will be Paid DLC.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Movement</strong>: There are many movement features to serve your needs, such as <i>Ziplines</i>, <i>Ladders</i>, <i>Wall Jumping</i>, and <i>Climbing</i><strong>.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Paintings</strong>: Submit your own art in our discord server and have it featured in the game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/d7815927c7910566f470347480d4471b.poster.avif?t=1755305113\" width=800 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/d7815927c7910566f470347480d4471b.webm?t=1755305113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/d7815927c7910566f470347480d4471b.mp4?t=1755305113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>This game wouldn't have been made if it wasn't for these amazing games inspiring me</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > DOORS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portal 1 &amp; 2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Karlson</p></li></ul>",
